      "message": "Yes, I found the dut won\u0027t auto boot up without this CL when I tried local build EC from the branch firmware-nissa-15217.B.\n\nEC log shows !ap-idle! when reconnect AC.\n```\n25-03-27 05:08:58.567 I: power state 6 \u003d S0, in 0x38d87\n25-03-27 05:09:03.479 \n25-03-27 05:09:03.481 ec:~\u003e \n25-03-27 05:09:03.865 ec:~\u003e \n25-03-27 05:09:04.099 ec:~\u003e \n25-03-27 05:09:04.288 ec:~\u003e [21.314880 System unlocked, TCPC I2C tunnels may be unprotected]\n25-03-27 05:09:12.332 ec:~\u003e I: power state 6 \u003d S0, in 0x30de3\n25-03-27 05:09:12.985 ð*** Booting Zephyr OS build 3.7.99 ***\n25-03-27 05:09:16.264 I: Pwrseq Init\n25-03-27 05:09:16.267 !\n25-03-27 05:09:16.267 !\n25-03-27 05:09:16.268 --- UART initialized after reboot ---\n25-03-27 05:09:16.271 ![Image: RO, dirks-0.0.0-8abaabc+ 2025-03-27 13:03:53 sue@sue-Predator-PH517-52]\n25-03-27 05:09:16.278 ![Reset cause: !reset-pin! !power-on! !ap-idle!]\n```",
