      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks to me that EC checks `PWR_SLP_SUS` and `PWR_DSW_PWROK` to determine whereher the power failure happens, it is worth to understand why EC fails to detect the power failure.",
      "revId": "59247a4bdab6cbfbb7004e818d8e5f246ea2080b",
